<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>02 / 现状盘点</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>AI 解题：已实现的三阶段流水线</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E9E62' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>已实现</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={190} viewBox='0 0 1140 190'><rect x='0' y='40' width='349' height='88' rx='8' fill='#0E2340' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='174.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>step_solver_only</text><text x='174.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>Solver：理解题目、给出完整解答</text><line x1='355' y1='84' x2='381' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M381 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='395' y='40' width='349' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='569.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>step_verify_all</text><text x='569.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>Verifier：检查并按步骤拆分、关联知识点</text><line x1='750' y1='84' x2='776' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M776 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='790' y='40' width='349' height='88' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='964.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>step_final_check</text><text x='964.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>Formatter：一致性检查与结构化输出</text></svg><svg width={1140} height={190} viewBox='0 0 1140 190'><rect x='0' y='10' width='1140' height='164' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='24' y='44' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='700'>核心字段</text><text x='24' y='76' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>chunk_id · step_number · title · step_level1 · standard_writing · detailed_writing · knowledge_point · step_difficulty</text><text x='24' y='110' font-size='15' fill='#E8A33D' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>容错：Formatter 失败时重跑 Verifier 再试 Formatter；仍失败返回 error=formatter_failed、formatter_fallback=true</text><text x='24' y='146' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>陷阱：step_level1 是历史字段名，实际承载二级具体步骤名，不能凭名字理解层级；并非所有解析步骤都被强制映射成 YAML 唯一 ID</text></svg><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E7BE0', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>标准过程用于呈现关键推导与得分内容，详细过程用于帮助理解。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：当前实现能力与名词数量.md §3</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 15 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>